# =============================================================================
# Sentinel .gitignore — strict NDA-aware ruleset
# =============================================================================
# Authored 2026-05-14 during /gsd-execute-phase 1 init. Default = exclude. Add
# specific allow-list rules below only after confirming the path is non-sensitive.
# When in doubt, leave it ignored — a leaked client artifact is irreversible.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NDA-protected client engagement data (HARD RULES — never relax these)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
engagements/
runs/
reports/
deliverables/
workspaces/
library/
.audit-*.jsonl
.audit-*.jsonl.*
*.sow.pdf
*-sow.pdf
*-SOW.pdf
SOW-*.pdf

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets / credentials
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.csr
*credentials*
*secret*
*.htpasswd
*api-key*
*token*.txt
notify.yaml
.sentinel/
# Quick 260517-f7a (2026-05-17): .sentinel/ above already covers
# .sentinel/<engagement_id>.creds.json (the human-signup creds artifact).
# Listed here as a reminder to future operators reading the file —
# do NOT remove the .sentinel/ rule above, it is the legal NDA boundary.
# .sentinel/*.creds.json   # covered by .sentinel/ — kept as documentation anchor

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Operator-installed vendor extensions (Quick 260517-f7a, 2026-05-17)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# external/ holds third-party browser extensions installed via
# tools/install-nopecha-extension.sh (and any future vendor installers).
# Never check in — operator-managed, may have license restrictions,
# typically large binary blobs.
external/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python virtualenvs + bytecode + build artifacts
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
.venv-*/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.egg-info/
*.egg
build/
dist/
.eggs/
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test + coverage artifacts
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
pytest-cache-files-*/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/
.cache/
coverage.xml
*.cover
.hypothesis/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Model adapters + training artifacts (large, often contain engagement data)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
adapters-*/
*.safetensors
*.gguf
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
mlx-*.log
mlx-train*.log
*.npz
checkpoints/
wandb/
mlruns/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs + temporary state
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
logs/
*.log
*.log.*
*.pid
tmp/
.tmp/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / IDE clutter
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-project

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Streamlit / FastAPI runtime state
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GSD planning artifacts — commit_docs: false per project decision
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.planning/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-machine context docs (mention engagement/client data inline)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
CURRENT_STATE.md
HANDOFF.md
HANDOFF-*.md
CLOUD-SCAN-RESULT.md
autonomous-training-results.md
*.handoff.md

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated vault content + corpus state
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# vault-seed/Knowledge/ is INTENTIONALLY tracked (3,778 pre-generated notes are
# part of the repo per CLAUDE.md). Anything under vault-seed/ that's specific to
# an engagement should live under engagements/ instead.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Misc training tools that may pull engagement data
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.qwen-eval.json
*.candidate.json
runs-training-*.md

# Allow public template/doc files (override broad rules above)
!.env.example
!scope.example.yaml
!README.md
!LICENSE
